<title>CANADA: BC Tel gets right to apply for TV license.</title>
<headline>BC Tel gets right to apply for TV license.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BC Telecom Inc said on Wednesday that Canada's federal government agreed to allow it to apply for a broadcast license that would enable it to provide television service.</p>
<p>The federal cabinet approved a proposal to exempt the company from foreign ownership restrictions that apply to broadcasters.</p>
</text>
